title: TODO commit eval
pid: bb61006e-55b9-4aaf-87e1-6d8cd24df7cb
body: |2-
  Can ask for it for staged, unstaged or all changes.

  If a node is new, it's fine as long as it's valid.
  (What are the validation rules?
  Some relationships enable/preclude others.)

  If a node was removed, and all references to it removed,
  it is reported deleted and listed.

  Anything orphaned by a deletion is reported,
  with the corresponding deletion.
  Anything whose container(s) changed is reported as such.

  A new content is fine if _.

  [New|deleted] [rel type] is fine if _.

  Changes to text are reported.

  To test, compute this two ways: From disk and from dbs.
